  "body": {
    "type": "doc",
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "This recipe serves 4 and takes about 50 minutes from start to finish."
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Katsudon is a"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "donburi"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "built on a fried pork"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "katsu"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": ". The cutlet is cooked first, then briefly simmered with onion and egg in a sweet broth so it absorbs the sauce without losing all its crunch."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Pound the pork cutlets to an even thickness before breading. Uneven cutlets cook unevenly. A meat mallet or the base of a heavy pan both work."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "What you need"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
